      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndongera nkabaza nti: Mbega Imana yoba yarahevye abantu bayo ari bo Bisirayeli? Haba na mba! Jewe ubwanje ndi Umwisirayeli, uruvyaro rwa Aburahamu, nkaba nkomoka mu muryango wa Benyamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imana ntiyahevye abantu bayo yatoranije kuva kera. Mbega murazi ico Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga kuri ivyo? Uwavugishwa n’Imana Eliya yareze Abisirayeli ku Mana ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Uhoraho, bishe abavugishwa bawe, basangangura n’ibicaniro vyawe. Ni jewe jenyene nsigaye kandi nanje bariko barandondera ngo banyice.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "1 Abami 19:10,14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbega inyishu y’Imana yabaye iyihe? Yamubwiye iti: “Naribikiye abantu ibihumbi indwi batigeze bapfukamira ikigirwamana Bayali ngo bagisenge.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "1 Abami 19:18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No muri kino gihe ni ko bimeze, harasigaye Abisirayeli bakeya bakiri abizigirwa kuko ubuntu bw’Imana bwabazigamye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyo vyavuye ku buntu bw’Imana gusa, ntivyavuye ku bikorwa vyiza bakoze. Kuko, iyo biba vyavuye ku bikorwa vyiza bakoze, ubuntu bw’Imana ntibwoba bukibaye ubuntu vy’ukuri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbega ivyo bisigura iki? Bivuga ko benshi mu Bisirayeli bataronse kwemerwa n’Imana naho babironderana ishaka ryinshi. Ni abantu bakeya gusa batoranijwe n’Imana babironse, ariko imitima y’abandi yashishikaye gukomantara, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nk’uko Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga ngo:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero ndabaza: None abantu b’Imana baratsitaye bagwa ubutakivyuka? Haba na mba! Ariko kugwa kwabo kwatumye agakiza gashikira Abanyamahanga, kugira ngo bibatere kugira ishari, maze bipfuze ako gakiza na bo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimba kutumvira kwabo kwatungishije isi kandi nimba Abanyamahanga bahawe umugisha n’uko Abisirayeli banse agakiza, iyumvire ingene isi izohezagirwa igihe bazohindukirira Imana n’imitima yabo yose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni mwebwe Banyamahanga ndiko ndabwira kuko Imana yampamagariye kuba intumwa mu Banyamahanga. Ico gikorwa ndakinezererewe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kugira ngo ntume Abisirayeli bagirira ishari ico mwebwe abanyamahanga mufise, bikunze ndokore bamwe muri bo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko nimba kwigizwayo kwabo kwazaniye agakiza abo kw’isi bose, mbega kwemerwa kwabo ntikuzozana ivyiza birushirije? Bizomera nko gusubiza ubuzima abari barapfuye! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimba ikimanyu c’umukate cashikaniwe Imana nk’ivyeze ubwa mbere cejejwe, umukate wose uba wejejwe; kandi nimba imizi y’igiti yejejwe, n’amashami na yo nyene aba yejejwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwebwe abanyamahanga, mugereranywa n’amashami y’igiti c’umwelayo wo mw’ishamba, yatewe ku giti c’umwelayo wo mu murima. Mwasubiriye amwe mu mashami yaco yaciwe, muca musangira n’ayasigaye ingaburo iva mu mizi y’uwo mwelayo w’umurimano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero, ntimukishime kuri ayo mashami yaciwe, kuko mwebwe muri amashami gusa, ntimuri imizi. Imizi ni yo ibashigikiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko urashobora kuvuga uti: “Erega ayo mashami y’ukuri yaciwe kugira ngo nterwe mu kibanza cayo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukwo ni ukuri. Ariko wibuke ko ayo mashami yaciwe kubera ukutizera, kandi nawe uhagumijwe n’ukwizera. Rero, ntiwishime ahubwo utinye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko nimba Imana itihanganiye Abayuda bagereranywa n’amashami y’ukuri, na wewe yohava itakwihanganira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Raba rero ingene Imana igira neza, ariko kandi igahambara: yahambariye abaguye, ariko wewe ikugirira ubuntu, nimba ushishikara kugendera muri ukwo kugira neza kwayo. Bitari ukwo, na wewe uzocibwa nta kabuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Abisirayeli nibemera guhindukira bakava mu kutizera kwabo, bazosubira baterwe ku giti bahozeko, kuko Imana irashoboye kubikora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu vy’ukuri, wewe muri kamere muntu kawe umeze nk’ishami ry’umwelayo wo mw’ishamba. Nimba rero Imana yakoze ikintu kinyuranye n’uko ibintu bisanzwe bimeze, ikemera kugutera ku mwelayo wo mu murima, bizoyorohera cane gusubiza amashami y’ukuri aho yahoze?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bene Data, ndagomba ko mumenya iri banga ngira ndababwire kugira ngo bibarinde ubwibone. Bamwe mu Bisirayeli bafise imitima ikomantaye, ariko ivyo bizorangira igitigiri c’Abanyamahanga binjira mu gakiza gikwiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ico gihe, Abisirayeli bose bazokizwa, nk’uko handitswe ngo:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benshi mu Bisirayeli ubu ni abansi b’Ubutumwa Bwiza, kandi ivyo bizanira inyungu mwebwe abanyamahanga. Ariko, ku bijanye no gutoranywa, iracabakunda kubera ba Sekuruza babo Aburahamu, Isaka na Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko Imana idasubira ku ngabire yatanze canke ngo ihebe abo yatoranije, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nk’uko namwe abanyamahanga mwigeze kuba mu mugararizo, mutumvira Imana, ariko ubu mukaba mwaragiriwe imbabazi kubera Abisirayeli bagararije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaye abagarariji, kugira ngo nk’uko namwe mwagiriwe imbabazi, na bo baze bazigirirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko abantu bose baragararije Imana, bituma ibafata nk’imbohe. Ivyo ibikora kugira ngo ibagirire imbabazi bose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.32"
            ]
          }
        }
